Fix issue with CollectionID.

CollectionIDs are not assigned until collections are written; therefore,
we cannot in general use them to distinguish collections in
digitization/reconstruction.  Rework GGTFTrackFinder to use the index
in the input collection sequence rather than collectionID to identify
collections.  Fixes test failures for ALLEGRO and IDEA seen in FCC-config.
